        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;i&gt;The project deliverable ends at the forecast. The dispatch decision is the operational use it informs.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5a6570;" vertex="1" parent="1">
